Better approach: reference elements using valid declared identifiers in scope, and model an interaction between distinct participants.

```likec4
model {
  system api_container 'API Container'
  component auth_component 'Auth Component'
}

views {
  dynamic auth_component_interaction {
    title 'Auth Interaction'

    api_container -> auth_component 'Request authentication check'
    auth_component -> api_container 'Return auth verdict'
  }
}
```

This keeps the dynamic sequence explicit and avoids invalid path-like shorthand usage.
